    "title": "Tamron Hall Fans Will Be Surprised by How Much $$ She Makes to Host Her Talk Show",
    "text": "\"Hearst Magazines and Yahoo may earn commission or revenue on some items through these links.\"In the world of daytime TV hosts, Tamron Hall is one of the familiar faces viewers can watch on screen every weekday.As the host of The Tamron Hall Show, people know Tamron for opening up about the latest in current events and pop culture. But she also is someone who loves to participate in charity work, be a doting wife to husband Steven Greener, and be present as a mom for her son Moses. And this is all as her hit syndicated talk show is coming back for season 7 on September 8, 2025.Given how Tamron is a busy lady, some may be curious to know more about Tamron Hall's net worth in 2025. Based on what we uncovered, Tamron makes a lot of money from more than just hosting The Tamron Hall Show.Lou Rocco - Getty ImagesWhat is Tamron Hall's net worth in 2025?According to a report from CelebrityNetWorth.com, Tamron Hall's net worth is estimated to be around $7 million in 2025.For those curious about how Tamron amassed all of that wealth, it comes from both her hit daytime series and a number of different projects she works on.How much does Tamron Hall make as host of The Tamron Hall Show?While there aren't any official reports indicating Tamron's salary for The Tamron Hall Show, the website did note she likely makes around $2 million dollars for hosting her own syndicated talk show.It's also important to note that The Tamron Hall Show isn't the host's first foray into daytime television. Tamron has appeared on a number of well-known programs on NBC over the years, like Deadline, NewsNation With Tamron Hall, and plenty more. As for the job she had right before headlining her own talk show, though, Tamron was a co-host on the Today show from February 2014 to February 2017.Does Tamron Hall make money from other projects?Outside of her career as a reporter and TV host, Tamron Hall is also an accomplished author.In October 2021, Tamron published her first novel, titled As the Wicked Watch: The First Jordan Manning Novel. She later wrote a sequel that debuted in March 2024, and she also wrote her own cookbook (titled A Confident Cook: Recipes for Joyous, No Pressure Fun in the Kitchen) that same year. What's more, she expanded into the world of children's books with the March 2025 release of Harlem Honey: The Adventures of a Curious Kid.You Might Also Like",
